#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50 index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; is a computerized version of a well known strategy game. "
"Commercial and other Free Software versions exist but I (Gaël de Chalendar) "
"created this game initially as a C++ learning exercise and so, I developed "
"it up to this point (see README for details)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55 index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the current version, &kappname; is a multi-player network-enabled game "
"with an AI. (see TODO for details)"
msgstr ""

