#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then, if you choose to play with goal, the goal of each local player is "
"displayed, preceded by a warning such that other players looking at the same "
"computer can discreetly turn away while the goal is being viewed."
