#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating new skins"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:666
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; comes with a skin editor, named ksirkskineditor(!), that allows "
"to edit all skin data, as soon as graphics (map, sprites, etc.) are "
"available in a SVG file. Please see the ksirkskineditor manual for further "
"details."
msgstr ""

